        "message": {
          "content": "A\n\n**Explanation:** Leaving the city does nothing to alleviate the child's suffering or improve the situation of anyone involved; it merely causes you to lose your home, loved ones, and well-being. Because walking away subtracts personal happiness from the world without reducing any misery, it results in a net loss of overall welfare. Staying allows you to preserve your well-being and contribute positively to the lives of those around you, maintaining the greatest possible balance of flourishing over suffering given the tragic and unalterable constraints of the scenario.",
